+    """Pure Python fallback for _posixsubprocess.fork_exec().
+
+    Implements the same contract: fork a child, set up fds/signals/credentials
+    in the child, exec the target program, and write errors to errpipe on
+    failure.  Returns the child PID in the parent; raises OSError if fork()
+    itself fails.
